(5541565, 800860, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice rusty-crusty. Could have perhaps benefited from a touch more sharpening. Old rust loves to be sharpened. Still worth a solid 6 from me though.</td>', 'Nice rusty-crusty. Could have perhaps benefited from a touch more sharpening. Old rust loves to be sharpened. Still worth a solid 6 from me though.', '2009-06-24 01:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
