(5541995, 801416, 15711, '<td valign="top">My sister and several of her friends moved to LA in the late 80''s. For a friend''s birthday (he was this quirky guy who wore bowling shoes to a wedding), they had longhorns mounted to his Cadillac.  I still laugh whenever I think about the looks he got. Thanks for the memory.</td>', 'My sister and several of her friends moved to LA in the late 80''s. For a friend''s birthday (he was this quirky guy who wore bowling shoes to a wedding), they had longhorns mounted to his Cadillac.  I still laugh whenever I think about the looks he got. Thanks for the memory.', '2009-06-24 08:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
