(5542519, 801272, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here with good effort on the panning of the car. I think it could do with a little boost on the levels and exposure. This little jumbo seems to be reallymoving fast with the rims blured nicely to add to that effect. Curious to see sutter speed at the end.</td>', 'Nice shot here with good effort on the panning of the car. I think it could do with a little boost on the levels and exposure. This little jumbo seems to be reallymoving fast with the rims blured nicely to add to that effect. Curious to see sutter speed at the end.', '2009-06-24 14:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5542526, 800890, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  70? 71?  Like the selective desat.  Wish the image had a shallower DOF (to blur the trees in the back).  I think voters might ding you on the fence in the background for being distracting.  I think a little bit more space on the left side may have helped.  Best of luck on the voting.</td>', 'Great shot.  70? 71?  Like the selective desat.  Wish the image had a shallower DOF (to blur the trees in the back).  I think voters might ding you on the fence in the background for being distracting.  I think a little bit more space on the left side may have helped.  Best of luck on the voting.', '2009-06-24 14:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5542553, 801415, 103032, '<td valign="top">IMHO, car shots can be tough.  The composition in this shot is pretty good, maybe just a bit tight, but the angle is good.  The lighting and focus is fine.  I think this shot of this car would have been stronger if a different (darker?) back drop was used as oppose to the silver metal curtain wall back drop with a lot of horizontal lines that distract/compete with the lines of the car.  As is, the top half and the back half of the Jag kind of gets lost.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'IMHO, car shots can be tough.  The composition in this shot is pretty good, maybe just a bit tight, but the angle is good.  The lighting and focus is fine.  I think this shot of this car would have been stronger if a different (darker?) back drop was used as oppose to the silver metal curtain wall back drop with a lot of horizontal lines that distract/compete with the lines of the car.  As is, the top half and the back half of the Jag kind of gets lost.  Good luck on the voting.', '2009-06-24 14:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
