(5543099, 801411, 28359, '<td valign="top">A 64 GTO Convertible ? Stock duo-carbs? if not, still awesome ride. Lemans around same year?</td>', 'A 64 GTO Convertible ? Stock duo-carbs? if not, still awesome ride. Lemans around same year?', '2009-06-24 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543211, 800413, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautifully framed with great colors. The frame doesn''t do much for me, and the post processing looks a bit heavy handed.</td>', 'Beautifully framed with great colors. The frame doesn''t do much for me, and the post processing looks a bit heavy handed.', '2009-06-25 01:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543212, 800650, 16106, '<td valign="top">great find, lots of textures and tones, I just wish you could have taken a crowbar to the post and 2x in the foreground.</td>', 'great find, lots of textures and tones, I just wish you could have taken a crowbar to the post and 2x in the foreground.', '2009-06-25 01:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543228, 801160, 15511, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best compositions in this challenge. Well done.</td>', 'This is one of the best compositions in this challenge. Well done.', '2009-06-25 01:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543308, 801415, 101457, '<td valign="top">nice car,but old?</td>', 'nice car,but old?', '2009-06-25 05:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543322, 800728, 103032, '<td valign="top">Too much sky that doesn''t add to the image.  Maybe a square framing would have made the image stronger.  Composition wise, I think the car positioned to the right a little bit more would have been more pleasing (I think viewers generally have a better perception of a car coming into the frame rather than going out of the frame). IMO.  Nice very old car though.</td>', 'Too much sky that doesn''t add to the image.  Maybe a square framing would have made the image stronger.  Composition wise, I think the car positioned to the right a little bit more would have been more pleasing (I think viewers generally have a better perception of a car coming into the frame rather than going out of the frame). IMO.  Nice very old car though.', '2009-06-25 07:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543326, 801716, 103032, '<td valign="top">Looks like a 50''s era PU, great subject for the challenge.  However, this image looks like a snapshot of someone else''s PU that you happen to see in their yard.<br/>1. The PU is such a small part of the photo; too many things going on in the pic to say that the PU is the main subject.<br/>2. Given that the PU is the main subject, the mailbox is right in front of it.<br/>3. If you were able to control the setting, the blue paint of the PU would have been perfect in front of the red barn with the barn door closed... That would have made an awesome image for the challenge.<br/>Just my honest critique...</td>', 'Looks like a 50''s era PU, great subject for the challenge.  However, this image looks like a snapshot of someone else''s PU that you happen to see in their yard.1. The PU is such a small part of the photo; too many things going on in the pic to say that the PU is the main subject.2. Given that the PU is the main subject, the mailbox is right in front of it.3. If you were able to control the setting, the blue paint of the PU would have been perfect in front of the red barn with the barn door closed... That would have made an awesome image for the challenge.Just my honest critique...', '2009-06-25 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543328, 800650, 103032, '<td valign="top">The old rusted PU is a great subject.  However, this looks like a snapshot because of the post and the rail in front of the PU.  The crop is super tight anyways with the tires cut off, so maybe a tight strait on shot would have worked better.  Just my humble opinion.</td>', 'The old rusted PU is a great subject.  However, this looks like a snapshot because of the post and the rail in front of the PU.  The crop is super tight anyways with the tires cut off, so maybe a tight strait on shot would have worked better.  Just my humble opinion.', '2009-06-25 07:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543330, 801223, 103032, '<td valign="top">The old car doesn''t look like it was movable.  That being the case, maybe you could have shot it at a slightly different angle, moving to your left to compose the distractions in the left of the image out.</td>', 'The old car doesn''t look like it was movable.  That being the case, maybe you could have shot it at a slightly different angle, moving to your left to compose the distractions in the left of the image out.', '2009-06-25 07:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543331, 800337, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great car as the subject.  But wondering why crop it like this???  Would have like to have seen the entire car.</td>', 'Great car as the subject.  But wondering why crop it like this???  Would have like to have seen the entire car.', '2009-06-25 08:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543332, 800432, 103032, '<td valign="top">Good shot, good subject.  Composition works for me, balance wise...</td>', 'Good shot, good subject.  Composition works for me, balance wise...', '2009-06-25 08:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543334, 801416, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective... but its a little too low.  I''d rather see the rest of the car rather than the undercarriage.  I''m kind of thinking this was a snapshot where you had no control of the car.  The wires and power line and barbed wire fence are distracting.  The building on the right is distracting.</td>', 'Interesting perspective... but its a little too low.  I''d rather see the rest of the car rather than the undercarriage.  I''m kind of thinking this was a snapshot where you had no control of the car.  The wires and power line and barbed wire fence are distracting.  The building on the right is distracting.', '2009-06-25 08:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543462, 801160, 78371, '<td valign="top">This is my highest rated photograph.  Everything seems to fit, the location, time of day and the gentleman standing on the left.</td>', 'This is my highest rated photograph.  Everything seems to fit, the location, time of day and the gentleman standing on the left.', '2009-06-25 11:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543470, 800887, 78371, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious. I like that the truck is in a industrial-like area to give the illusion that Mater is actually working on some piece of construction.</td>', 'This is hilarious. I like that the truck is in a industrial-like area to give the illusion that Mater is actually working on some piece of construction.', '2009-06-25 11:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543472, 801611, 78371, '<td valign="top">I like the complementary color play in the this photograph however the photograph is just a tad bit too dark.</td>', 'I like the complementary color play in the this photograph however the photograph is just a tad bit too dark.', '2009-06-25 11:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5543473, 801268, 98339, '<td valign="top">such a shame to let these vehicles rot...but then it would cost a pretty penny to restore them wouldn''t it...nice shot</td>', 'such a shame to let these vehicles rot...but then it would cost a pretty penny to restore them wouldn''t it...nice shot', '2009-06-25 11:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
