(5544914, 801416, 78371, '<td valign="top">Best hood ornament ever!  The angle is great. I just wish this was advanced editing so that the power lines could be taken out.  I think that the muted colors sort of give this photograph an old polaroid feel. The quality is much better, of course, than an old polaroid though.</td>', 'Best hood ornament ever!  The angle is great. I just wish this was advanced editing so that the power lines could be taken out.  I think that the muted colors sort of give this photograph an old polaroid feel. The quality is much better, of course, than an old polaroid though.', '2009-06-26 09:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
