(5550019, 800762, 36616, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately not my favourite photo in this comp. Fond memories of my first four wheeler. This one looks only marginally worse for wear than my £5.00 acquisition in 1968. Good luck.</td>', 'Unfortunately not my favourite photo in this comp. Fond memories of my first four wheeler. This one looks only marginally worse for wear than my £5.00 acquisition in 1968. Good luck.', '2009-06-29 19:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
