(5562330, 800197, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hello, Sled Zepplin, found this in the Critique Club section:<br/> <br/>PROS: First thought when looking at this photo is, Nice Car! Love the Thunderbird, always did, so I can''t possibly say I don''t like the photo overall. <br/> <br/>FLAWS: The composition is ok, but the cropping of the right side of it is depriving. Also, the car doesn''t fill the frame. With a close crop of just a part of a car, the car should take up the majority of the frame; since the remaining part of the image consists of a bland background. I also find no impact in the natural lighting used here. <br/> <br/>I do think the photo scored well, and it''s a decent shot. It could have been alot better with better lighting and slight improvement in framing.</td>', 'Hello, Sled Zepplin, found this in the Critique Club section: PROS: First thought when looking at this photo is, Nice Car! Love the Thunderbird, always did, so I can''t possibly say I don''t like the photo overall.  FLAWS: The composition is ok, but the cropping of the right side of it is depriving. Also, the car doesn''t fill the frame. With a close crop of just a part of a car, the car should take up the majority of the frame; since the remaining part of the image consists of a bland background. I also find no impact in the natural lighting used here.  I do think the photo scored well, and it''s a decent shot. It could have been alot better with better lighting and slight improvement in framing.', '2009-07-06 22:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
